# Consume-only: @coderabbitai/config (the root package.json's devDependency)
# is a public package, installed from public npm. A user-level ~/.npmrc may
# send the @coderabbitai scope to another registry (GitHub Packages answers
# 403/404 for it), and bun prefers this file over the user's, so the scope is
# pinned back to npm here. Nothing of allthings is published to that scope.
# Every workspace (core/, web/, ...) installs through this root.
@coderabbitai:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
